# Lock files.
#
# Dependency locks are already excluded individually above (`**/poetry.lock`,
# `web/spago.lock`, `Chart.lock`): this repository pins in the manifests
# themselves — `pyproject.toml`, `spago.yaml`, `infernix.cabal` — for the same
# reason it version-controls no `.dhall`. This pattern generalizes that, and also
# covers the runtime mutual-exclusion sidecars the binary creates outside the
# already-ignored `.data/` and `.build/` roots: `.infernix-poetry-install.lock`,
# `.infernix-generated-proto.lock`, `.infernix-download-cache.lock`,
# `.materialization.lock`, `.generation-lease-*.lock`, and
# `cluster-lifecycle.lock`. A lock is live process state, never source.
#
# An unanchored pattern matches at every depth in git, so this needs no `**/`.
# `web/package-lock.json` is deliberately kept above: it does not end in `.lock`.
*.lock

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
.DS_Store
tmp/
.tmp/
